This is a fork, not a vendored copy: crossglyph adds rasterization knobs upstream
does not have (gamma, AA thresholds, weight, slant, hinting, stem darkening).
`uv run tools/refresh_cpfont.py` fetches upstream and shows a diff against the
fork so changes can be merged by hand. Do not overwrite.

The twelve bundled Noto fallback faces are NOT forked -- they are still read
from the crosspoint-tools clone beside this one, since only the script diverges.
